       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "additionalProperties": true,
         "title": "Response",
         "type": "object"
        }
       }
      }
     }
    },
    "description": "An instant event of the calling case (n8n execution) in the event log, e.g. a BPMN Error\nEnd Event; the activity is the X-Bpmn8n-Activity header (the n8n node name). Returns the\nmessage with its variables filled in.",
